From 7d563522c35d947ed84968b2947d7748f694ead2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:38:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] Implement xdg-toplevel-icon-v1

Vendor the staging xdg-toplevel-icon-v1 protocol. set_name is ignored
(macOS has no icon themes); add_buffer collects (buffer, scale) pairs
each with a destroy listener, mirroring the toplevel-decoration
tracking pattern. set_icon picks the highest-scale surviving buffer,
invalidates then renders it to an NSImage, and applies it via
NSWindow.setMiniwindowImage:, clearing the image for a null icon or a
toplevel with no window yet.
